  "description": "NIMPEH crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C69 H65 Dy3 N9 O18 1+,C1 H4 O1,Cl1 1-,C4 H10 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.521-3.603 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.62-101.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C139H141Dy6Cl3N18O40.",
